<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Mobiliteitsdienst> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Service that enables movement of Persons between Locations."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "By this we mean both classic mobility services such as public transport (typically offered as a scheduled service, for example metro line 5 in Brussels), but also shared transport such as free-floating shared scooters (e.g. shared scooters in large cities)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Routesegment> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Part of a Route that is traveled without a Connection using the same means of transport."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Route>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Route> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Possible, chosen or traveled route between two Locations (the starting point and the arrival point respectively)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Resource> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Means that the Mobility Service can offer to the Traveller to make his journey."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "For example, seat on a train, shared bike at a station, parking space in a car park."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Overstap> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Logical connection between two Route Nodes."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Intended to describe the transition between two Route Segments if it is not itself represented by a Route Segment. You can change between two of the same Route nodes (e.g. transfer from one train to another in the same station) or between two different ones (e.g. transfer from the car park at the station to - the platforms of - the station)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Vervoersbewijs> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proof of certain right to transport or services associated with it."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Transport or service are still to be consumed or already consumed. Typically a ticket for or a subscription to a Mobility Service such as public transport, but can also be, for example, a parking ticket."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Aanbieder> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Registered Organisation providing Mobility Services."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/regorg#RegisteredOrganization>;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "A Registered Organisation is defined as an Organisation with a legal status (established by registration), e.g. NV, non-profit organisation, etc."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Boeking> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Recording a Trip by purchasing a Transport Ticket and/or reserving a Resource."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "For example, purchasing a train ticket or reserving a seat on the train."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Routeplanner> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Software that can be used to calculate the Route of a Trip."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/Agent>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Reservatie> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Characteristics of the Resource Reservation with a Booking."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Routeknoop> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Significant position in the Route that always coincides with the beginning or end of a Route Segment."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Transportconnectie> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Logical connection between two or more Transport objects in different Transport networks."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/transportnetwerk#Transportobject>, <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/netwerk#Connectie>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Voorkeur> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Traveler's preference."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "For example, route type, means of transport..."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Kenmerk> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Traveller's Feature."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "For example, age, disability, driver's license."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
