    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Person who undertakes or wants to undertake a Trip."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/Agent>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
